	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Keyword: s

Searches macOS System Settings: every pane, and every individual setting
Apple indexes, each opening the control directly.

Set the hotkey on the Hotkey object; it shows Alfred pre-filled with 's '.
For System Settings to stay out of Alfred's normal results, leave it
unticked under Features &gt; Default Results &gt; Essentials.

Source, and why it is built this way:
github.com/w0ng/dotfiles - alfred/workflows/system-settings</string>
